{"id":"int-54b2ba36c753749b034e4f65e6147d9d","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T14:24:16.449126638Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-h24o","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Removed buggy duplicate inline openPerformanceGraphModal from templates/index.html that overrode the correct ModalManager-based version in static/js/ui-controls.js. The inline version referenced undefined performanceGraphModal (ReferenceError) and loaded metrics on a hidden canvas before showing the modal, preventing Chart.js from rendering. Code review: APPROVED."}}
{"id":"int-6a4757b7cf9f78212b950f4ced060df3","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T15:23:02.393401811Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-o1xo","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed data format mismatch: /api/get-metrics returns flat single values but updateMetricsChart expected time-series arrays. Added history accumulation arrays (metricTimestamps, metricPromptTimes, metricPredictTimes, metricTokensGenerated) with MAX_METRIC_POINTS=50 cap. Modified loadModelMetrics to extract current values from flat API response, accumulate into history, and pass array-formatted data to updateMetricsChart. Also fixed: guards against missing event argument (event?.target?.value || modelSelect?.value), clears history when switching models (lastMetricModel tracking). Code review: APPROVED."}}
{"id":"int-49daa335513370bcfb2a87844c36a1a0","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T15:23:02.841272335Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-o1c3","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Resolved as part of web-o1xo fix: history arrays cleared on model switch (lastMetricModel tracking), event argument guarded with optional chaining. Code review APPROVED."}}
{"id":"int-42e1fce84ab377a03e84c97e40242623","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T15:23:04.366084772Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-ya4t","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Resolved as part of web-o1xo fix: history arrays cleared on model switch (lastMetricModel tracking), event argument guarded with optional chaining. Code review APPROVED."}}
{"id":"int-092e35ce2f89ebc8f13eab799e226c5a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T16:55:35.458070554Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-141p","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed: openExportConfigModal() called ModalManager.open('export-config-modal') AFTER awaiting fetchExportConfig(), so if the fetch hung (e.g. WSL networking), the modal never appeared. Moved ModalManager.open() BEFORE the try/catch block so the modal opens immediately on button click, then config loads asynchronously. Code review: APPROVED."}}
{"id":"int-de6ddcef020f53a2c852341e33ff7e75","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:18:37.313869748Z","actor":"Russell Powell","issue_id":"web-ci9x","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed: api_get_metrics() now falls back from get_server_host() (unreachable WSL/Windows host IP) to 127.0.0.1 so llama-server /metrics is reachable and loadModelMetrics() calls updateMetricsChart() to render the line graph. Code review APPROVED; full pytest suite passes (195 passed, 2 skipped)."}}
